# 2. Flutter Web Apps Assets & Shell proxy
/app/tutor/*   https://smartpath-apps-live.pages.dev/app/tutor/:splat   200!
/app/parent/*  https://smartpath-apps-live.pages.dev/app/parent/:splat  200!
/app/teacher/* https://smartpath-apps-live.pages.dev/app/teacher/:splat 200!
/app/admin/*   https://smartpath-apps-live.pages.dev/app/admin/:splat   200!

# 3. Clean user-friendly URLs to app shells
/tutor         /app/tutor/   302!
/tutor/*       /app/tutor/:splat   302!
/parent        /app/parent/  302!
/parents       /app/parent/  302!
/parent/*      /app/parent/:splat  302!
/teacher       /app/teacher/ 302!
